# Aiyaashi — frontend configuration
#
# Create React App only exposes variables prefixed REACT_APP_, and it inlines
# them at BUILD time. Anything here ships to the browser, so it must never hold
# a secret: no database URL, no API key, no provider credential. Those stay on
# the Render backend.
#
# Set this in the Vercel project settings (Production and Preview) as well as
# locally, or every request will be sent to this site's own origin and fail.
#
# The existing MetaShop API on Render — origin only, no trailing slash and no
# /api suffix; the application appends the paths itself.
REACT_APP_API_URL=https://your-metashop-api.onrender.com
